972
       second module gives bitwise agreement in 100% of rows for 28 of 40 blocks and in at least 75% for
973    the rest, with |Δ𝑃(yes)| > 0.1 in at most 1.9% of rows. Writes at the connector locus are an order of
974    magnitude smaller than those at the primary locus (median |𝑊𝑞,𝑞 | 0.009 against 0.046 on NIH and
975    0.008 against 0.270 on COCO).
